# Radium Documentation System

Before modifying code, check if the file belongs to a documented pillar and read the corresponding `.radium/` doc.

## Pillar Lookup

| Pillar | Doc | When to Read |
|--------|-----|-------------|
| @scaffald/ui | `.radium/scaffald-ui.md` | Editing UI components, tokens, or styles |
| @scaffald/sdk | `.radium/scaffald-sdk.md` | Creating/editing SDK hooks or mutations |
| Expo & Core App | `.radium/app-expo.md` | Editing app routes, layouts, or navigation |
| Supabase & Backend | `.radium/supabase-backend.md` | Editing edge functions or migrations |
| CI & Deployment | `.radium/ci-deployment.md` | Editing build config, CI, or dependencies |

## Quick Constraint Reminders

- **Color tokens**: `colors.bg[theme].default` NOT `colors.background[theme].default`
- **SDK hooks**: Always accept `UseMutationOptions` and spread with `...options`
- **Navigator wrappers**: NEVER conditionally render different wrappers around Stack/Drawer
- **@hookform/resolvers**: Must be `~3.1.0`, not `5.x`
- **Vitest 4**: Pool options are top-level, not nested in `poolOptions`
